#: cards:1
msgid "One assessment of condition at a particular point in time. "
msgstr "Satu penilaian kondisi pada suatu titik waktu. "

#: cards:1
msgid "Place 2"
msgstr "Tempat 2"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"For Actor resources: Describes the former and current residences of an Actor resource. Relates to Actor E39 with P74 \n"
"For Activity and Historic Event: Describes the location of where an activity or historic event took place. Relates to Activity E7 with P7. Relates to Historical Event E5 with P7\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk sumber daya Aktor: menguraikan tempat tinggal lama dan kini. Terhubung ke Aktor E39 dengan P74.\n"
"Untuk Aktivitas dan Peristiwa Sejarah: menguraikan lokasi kegiatan atau peristiwa. Terhubung ke Aktivitas E7 dengan P7. Terhubung ke Peristiwa Sejarah E5 dengan P7.\n"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Generic branch for capturing free-form written descriptive information.\n"
"Intended to be evolution from v3 description branch from HIP 3. Created semantic description node with description string and description type hanging off of it. Description (semantic node) becomes a grouping node (type and string).  \n"
"\n"
"This branch meets technical business rules for CRM compliance but CRM experts have said that this is an inappropriate implementation of E62.\n"
"\n"
"Connects to all resources with P140i"
msgstr ""
"Cabang generik untuk deskripsi tertulis bebas.\n"
"Dirancang sebagai evolusi cabang deskripsi HIP 3. Simpul deskripsi semantik dengan string dan jenis deskripsi. Deskripsi menjadi simpul pengelompokan (jenis dan string).\n"
"\n"
"Secara teknis memenuhi aturan CRM, tetapi ahli CRM menilai ini implementasi E62 yang kurang tepat.\n"
"\n"
"Terhubung ke semua sumber daya dengan P140i."

#: cards:1
msgid "Enter a description and description type for the resource."
msgstr "Masukkan deskripsi dan jenis deskripsi untuk sumber daya."

#: cards:1
msgid "Existence"
msgstr "Keberadaan"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Start/End dates for resources.  Assumed to be typed and within calendar time. \n"
"\n"
"Connects to Activity (E7) and Historical Event (E5) resource models via P114\n"
"Connects to Heritage Resource (E18) and Heritage Resource Group (E27) resource models via P12i\n"
"Connects to Actor (E39) resource model via P11i"
msgstr ""
"Tanggal mulai/akhir sumber daya, bertipe dan dalam kalender.\n"
"\n"
"Terhubung ke model Aktivitas (E7) dan Peristiwa Sejarah (E5) lewat P114.\n"
"Terhubung ke Sumber Daya Warisan (E18) dan Kelompok (E27) lewat P12i.\n"
"Terhubung ke Aktor (E39) lewat P11i."

#: cards:1
msgid "Record the start and end dates of the resource's existence."
msgstr "Catat tanggal mulai dan akhir keberadaan sumber daya."

#: cards:1
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Hak"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Captures information about special status, protection, or privileges afforded under law.\n"
"\n"
"Applies to: Heritage Resource, Heritage Resource Model"
msgstr ""
"Mencatat status khusus, perlindungan, atau hak istimewa menurut hukum.\n"
"\n"
"Berlaku untuk: Sumber Daya Warisan, Model Sumber Daya Warisan."

#: cards:1
msgid "Modification Event"
msgstr "Peristiwa modifikasi"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Describes the modification of a Heritage Resource.\n"
"\n"
"Connects to Heritage Resource (E18) via P12i"
msgstr ""
"Menguraikan modifikasi Sumber Daya Warisan.\n"
"\n"
"Terhubung ke Sumber Daya Warisan (E18) lewat P12i."

#: cards:1
msgid "Describe modification or alteration to the resource."
msgstr "Uraikan modifikasi atau perubahan pada sumber daya."

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"The name of a resource.\n"
"\n"
"Applies to Heritage Resource, Heritage Resource Group, Activity, and Historical Event.  Actors receive their \"names\" from the Appellation branch."
msgstr ""
"Nama sumber daya.\n"
"\n"
"Berlaku untuk Sumber Daya Warisan, Kelompok Sumber Daya Warisan, Aktivitas, dan Peristiwa Sejarah. Aktor mendapat nama dari cabang Sebutan."

#: cards:1
msgid "Enter the resource name and its respective type."
msgstr "Masukkan nama sumber daya dan jenisnya."

#: cards:1
msgid "Physical thing on a heritage resource. Connect to Heritage Resource E18 via P46"
msgstr "Benda fisik pada sumber daya warisan. Terhubung ke Sumber Daya Warisan E18 lewat P46."

#: cards:1
msgid "Select the architectural component and the component's material and technique"
msgstr "Pilih komponen arsitektur beserta bahan dan tekniknya"

#: cards:1
msgid "Heritage Resource Phase Type"
msgstr "Jenis fase sumber daya warisan"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Phase Type Assignments for Heritage Resource E18.\n"
"\n"
"Connects via P92i"
msgstr ""
"Penugasan jenis fase untuk Sumber Daya Warisan E18.\n"
"\n"
"Terhubung lewat P92i."

#: cards:1
msgid "Activity Phase"
msgstr "Fase aktivitas"

#: cards:1
msgid "Describes the time span and type of an Activity Resource."
msgstr "Menguraikan rentang waktu dan jenis sumber daya Aktivitas."

#: cards:1
msgid "Event Phase Type"
msgstr "Jenis fase peristiwa"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Describes a Historical Event Type within a given timespan/phase. \n"
"\n"
"Connects to the Historical Event resource model via P10"
msgstr ""
"Menguraikan jenis peristiwa sejarah dalam rentang waktu/fase tertentu.\n"
"\n"
"Terhubung ke model Peristiwa Sejarah lewat P10."

#: cards:1
msgid "Define one Event Type, n cultural periods, and (optionally) one from/to date range. Additional Event Types or date ranges requires additional entries"
msgstr "Tentukan satu jenis peristiwa, n periode budaya, dan (opsional) satu rentang tanggal dari/hingga. Jenis peristiwa atau rentang tanggal tambahan memerlukan entri tambahan."

#: cards:1
msgid "Describes the title of an Information Resource."
msgstr "Menguraikan judul sumber informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "Enter the information resource's title and the type of that title. "
msgstr "Masukkan judul sumber informasi dan jenis judul itu. "

#: cards:1
msgid "This branch describes the language of an Information Resource."
msgstr "Cabang ini menguraikan bahasa sumber informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "Select language of the information resource."
msgstr "Pilih bahasa sumber informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "Information Resource Creation Event"
msgstr "Peristiwa pembuatan sumber informasi"

#: cards:1
msgid "Describes the creators, contributors, type, and date of a creation and/or update event of an information resource."
msgstr "Menguraikan pembuat, kontributor, jenis, dan tanggal pembuatan dan/atau pembaruan sumber informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "Describe the information resource  and its date of creation"
msgstr "Uraikan sumber informasi dan tanggal pembuatannya"

#: cards:1
msgid "Resource Update Event"
msgstr "Peristiwa pembaruan sumber daya"

#: cards:1
msgid "This is intended as a sub-branch to Resource Creation Event within the Information Resource Resource Model.  Stores the date when an update to the information resource occurred."
msgstr "Subcabang Peristiwa Pembuatan dalam model Sumber Informasi. Menyimpan tanggal pembaruan sumber informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "Select the date the information resource was updated. "
msgstr "Pilih tanggal sumber informasi diperbarui. "

#: cards:1
msgid "Information Resource Copyright"
msgstr "Hak cipta sumber informasi"

#: cards:1
msgid "Used to define legal privileges associated with an Information Resource."
msgstr "Menentukan hak hukum yang terkait dengan sumber informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "Describe the copyright for the information resource."
msgstr "Uraikan hak cipta sumber informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "An object or substance used to record and accumulate data"
msgstr "Objek atau bahan yang dipakai untuk merekam dan mengumpulkan data"

#: cards:1
msgid "Select the information carrier for the information resource."
msgstr "Pilih pembawa informasi untuk sumber informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "Publication Event"
msgstr "Peristiwa terbit"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"This branch describes the publication of an Information Resource.\n"
"\n"
"Connects to Information Resource (E73) with -P128"
msgstr ""
"Cabang ini menguraikan penerbitan sumber informasi.\n"
"\n"
"Terhubung ke Sumber Informasi (E73) dengan -P128."

