msgid "<p>You can see the color ramps at:</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/d3/d3-3.x-api-reference/blob/master/Ordinal-Scales.md\"><font color=\"#f7f7f7\">https://github.com/d3/d3-3.x-api-reference/blob/master/Ordinal-Scales.md</font></a><br></p>"
