#: cards:1
msgid "Describes the location of an information resource. Relates to Information Resource E73 with P67"
msgstr "Menguraikan lokasi sumber informasi. Terhubung ke Sumber Informasi E73 dengan P67."

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Defines time span for which the Information Resource is relevant.\n"
"Applies to: Information Resource"
msgstr ""
"Menentukan rentang waktu relevansi sumber informasi.\n"
"Berlaku untuk: Sumber Informasi."

#: cards:1
msgid "Describe the temporal coverage of the information resource's subject. "
msgstr "Uraikan cakupan temporal subjek sumber informasi. "

