msgid "End of Existence"
msgstr "Akhir keberadaan"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Describes the type and time span of the end of a resource's existence.\n"
"\n"
"Relates to the Actor E39 Resource Model via P93i"
msgstr ""
"Menguraikan jenis dan rentang waktu akhir keberadaan sumber daya.\n"
"\n"
"Terhubung ke model Aktor E39 lewat P93i."

#: cards:1
msgid "Please enter the date of the end of existence for the resource."
msgstr "Masukkan tanggal akhir keberadaan sumber daya."

