msgid "Beginning of Existence"
msgstr "Awal keberadaan"

#: cards:1
msgid ""
"Describes the type and time span of the beginning of a resource's existence.\n"
"\n"
"Relates to the Actor resource model E39 via P92i.\n"
"Relates to Historic Event E5 and Activity E7 via p116i."
msgstr ""
"Menguraikan jenis dan rentang waktu awal keberadaan sumber daya.\n"
"\n"
"Terhubung ke model Aktor E39 lewat P92i.\n"
"Terhubung ke Peristiwa Sejarah E5 dan Aktivitas E7 lewat p116i."

#: cards:1
msgid "Please enter the date of the beginning of existence for the resource."
msgstr "Masukkan tanggal awal keberadaan sumber daya."

